                                                "text": "The Nimrods committed another dismaying turnover en route to another humiliating loss."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb8fb784-d27c-4d5a-a4e2-d146a5597ba1",
                                                "sense_id": "853845fb-2035-33d0-8de1-5e08ce61824c",
